Looking for audio visual rental for training sessions in Malaga? A training session is not a static presentation: trainers move between breakout groups, connect their own laptop for slides, and need a microphone that keeps up when they are not standing still.

Malaga Event Gear delivers, installs and tests sound, screens and microphones sized to your group across Malaga and the wider Costa del Sol.

Contact us today to elevate your next training session.

## Brief Overview

---

Malaga Event Gear provides audio visual rental for training sessions in Malaga and Granada, sized to your group from a small laptop-driven workshop up to a full room of 120. Backed by experience going back to 1996, we deliver, install and test sound, screens and microphones so your trainer can focus on the session, not the equipment.

Contact us today to discuss your training session.

## Key Highlights

---

Malaga Event Gear provides audio visual rental for training sessions in Malaga and Granada.

-   Packages sized to your group, from a small laptop-driven workshop up to a full room of 120.

-   Wireless microphones for a trainer who moves between breakout groups, not just standing at a podium.

-   HDMI and USB-C adapters to connect your own laptop for training slides.

-   Available in Malaga and extending to Granada for rentals over 400 euros, with booking at least 24 hours in advance.

## Match Your Training Session to a Package

Group size and format decide the right setup:

-   **Small, laptop-driven workshop**: the [Product Presentation Pack](/packages/product-presentation/) includes a sound system with mixing console, a wireless microphone, a laser projector and screen, plus HDMI and USB-C adapters to connect your own training slides. No technician included, self-run.
-   **Mid-size training session, up to 40**: the [Basic MICE Pack](/packages/basic-mice/) covers sound, a gooseneck microphone and a projector, with a technician available as an add on if you want one running the room.
-   **Full training day, up to 120**: the [MICE Pack](/packages/mice/) covers sound, a gooseneck and wireless microphone, a 60 inch LED display, and a technician included on site for up to six hours.

See live pricing and full inclusions for each on our [packages page](/packages/).

<InlineCTA />

## Trainer Mobility: Wireless Mics Between Breakout Groups

A trainer running hands-on exercises does not stay at a podium. Our wireless handheld microphones, included on the Product Presentation Pack and MICE Pack, let a trainer move freely between breakout groups and exercise stations without losing sound clarity, while the [Basic MICE Pack](/packages/basic-mice/)'s gooseneck microphone suits a trainer who mostly presents from the front of the room.

## Connect Your Own Training Materials

Our [Product Presentation Pack](/packages/product-presentation/) includes HDMI and USB-C adapters plus audio interfaces to connect your own laptop, tablet or media player to our sound and screen setup, so your slides and materials run exactly as you built them.

