## FAQs

### What AV equipment do I need for a training session?

It depends on your group size and format. A small, laptop-driven workshop needs a sound system, a wireless microphone and a projector, which the [Product Presentation Pack](/packages/product-presentation/) covers. A larger session benefits from a bigger screen and a technician, which the [Basic MICE Pack](/packages/basic-mice/) and [MICE Pack](/packages/mice/) cover. See [Match Your Training Session to a Package](#match-your-training-session-to-a-package) above.

### Is my training session too small for professional AV support?

No. Our [Product Presentation Pack](/packages/product-presentation/) is built for a small, laptop-driven session, with sound, a wireless microphone and a projector delivered, installed and tested by our crew.

### Do you provide on-site technical support during the session, or is it drop-off equipment only?

It depends on the package. The [Product Presentation Pack](/packages/product-presentation/) is delivered, installed and tested by our crew, then run by you. The [Basic MICE Pack](/packages/basic-mice/) offers a technician as an add on, and the [MICE Pack](/packages/mice/) includes one on site for up to six hours.

### Can the AV setup handle a trainer moving between breakout groups?

Yes. Our wireless handheld microphones, included on the Product Presentation Pack and MICE Pack, let a trainer move freely between groups and exercise stations without losing sound clarity. See [Trainer Mobility](#trainer-mobility-wireless-mics-between-breakout-groups) above.

### Can I connect my own laptop for my training slides?

Yes. The [Product Presentation Pack](/packages/product-presentation/) includes HDMI and USB-C adapters plus audio interfaces to connect your own laptop, tablet or media player.

### What areas do you cover, and how far in advance should I book?

Our services are available in Malaga and extend to Granada for rentals over 400 euros. Book at least 24 hours in advance to guarantee availability.
